# Dev security

- **Never** commit secrets, tokens, passwords, or private keys.
- Use environment variables or approved secret stores; flag hardcoded credentials in review.
- Be aware of injection, XSS, auth bypass in generated code.
- Do not log PII or credentials.
- Flag use of deprecated crypto or unsafe defaults.

If secrets are found in working tree, warn user and do not replicate in new code.
